diff --git a/README.md b/README.md
index db5a398..0760dac 100644
--- a/README.md
+++ b/README.md
@@ -21,6 +21,15 @@ The build will create two jar files:
 * the command line interface in the cli/target folder
 * the interactive explorer in the codeexplorer/target folder
 
+### Command line
+
+* `init`: creates a new Sokrates analysis configuration file
+* `generateReports`: generates Sokrates reports based on the analysis configuration
+* `analyzeLandscape`: creates or updates a landscape report (portfolio view aggregating the analyses found under `-analysisRoot`) in `<folder>/_sokrates_landscape`. It is the landscape counterpart of the analysis commands and the same as `updateLandscape`
+* `updateLandscape`: the same as `analyzeLandscape`, kept for existing scripts
+
+Run `java -jar sokrates.jar <command> -help` for the options of a command.
+
 ### Docker
 
 Build the docker image:
